pistomp-wifi (1.0.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. Extracted from stage2/05-pistomp (03-run.sh) so the
    brcmfmac roamoff=0 fix reaches already-deployed devices via OTA, not
    just new images. Overrides the distro's
    /usr/lib/modprobe.d/rpi-brcmfmac.conf (firmware-nonfree, roamoff=1)
    with a same-basename file in /etc/modprobe.d/.

